# Hero video — the raw client source and the working trim preview stay OUT of git.
# Only the FINAL compressed clip (H.264, audio stripped, ~2-3MB) gets committed, and
# that final clip now LIVES AT brand_assets/hero-background.mp4 — so that path is
# deliberately NOT ignored. Raw sources belong in brand_assets/*-raw.* instead.
